      ENTIRE data field length (what RS sees).\n      - If Sec_Hdr_Flag=1, the first
      S bytes of the data field are the Secondary Header.\n      - FHP counts from
      the start of the Packet Zone (immediately after the SecHdr).\n    ", [''fill_byte'',
      ''scid'', ''sl_id'', ''vcid''])'
